# ISC dhcpd configuration: dhcpd.conf(5) manual page (ISC DHCP); requirements/languages/dhcpd.md
name     dhcpd dhcpdconf
keyword  subnet netmask range host option hardware ethernet fixed-address default-lease-time
keyword  max-lease-time authoritative shared-network group pool class allow deny include
builtin  routers domain-name domain-name-servers broadcast-address true false on off
ident-part     -
line-comment   #
string   " "  : escapes
operators  ;{},:
